        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—What color was this??? -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I can't remember familiar colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless I'm consciously aware of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it really that hard to tell?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find the true colors in a black-and-white picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I often have a vague memory of colors and locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- WASD character and viewpoint control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A simple game where you walk and find the correct answer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Guess the color marked with a red arrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Just follow the path of the color you think is correct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Answer 10 questions correctly in a row to successfully escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If you answer incorrectly, you start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proceed while tracing your vague memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Keyboard character control: WASD + viewpoint control: Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Controller support: Left stick (D-pad) for character control + right stick for viewpoint control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Reducing viewpoint movement reduces motion sickness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Keyboard or controller select: Pause menu settings and language change.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Production: 4th game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;TRUECOLOR&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Questions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Something feels off about the image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: It's an AI image, so it's not accurate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Aren't the colors different?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: It's not universal; it varies depending on the lighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work uses illustrations partially created by a generative AI (Midjourney).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For distribution guidelines, click &quot;Access the website&quot; on the page.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—What color was this??? -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I can't remember familiar colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless I'm consciously aware of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it really that hard to tell?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find the true colors in a black-and-white picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I often have a vague memory of colors and locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- WASD character and viewpoint control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A simple game where you walk and find the correct answer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Guess the color marked with a red arrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Just follow the path of the color you think is correct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Answer 10 questions correctly in a row to successfully escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If you answer incorrectly, you start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proceed while tracing your vague memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Keyboard character control: WASD + viewpoint control: Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Controller support: Left stick (D-pad) for character control + right stick for viewpoint control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Reducing viewpoint movement reduces motion sickness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Keyboard or controller select: Pause menu settings and language change.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Production: 4th game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;TRUECOLOR&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Questions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Something feels off about the image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: It's an AI image, so it's not accurate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Aren't the colors different?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: It's not universal; it varies depending on the lighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work uses illustrations partially created by a generative AI (Midjourney).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For distribution guidelines, click &quot;Access the website&quot; on the page.</p>",
